{"branch":"고잔점","html":"<section id=\"selected-directions\" class=\"km-directions\" aria-labelledby=\"selected-directions-title\" data-km-branch=\"고잔점\"><h3 id=\"selected-directions-title\">찾아오시는 길</h3><p class=\"km-intro\">고잔점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"km-map\" data-state=\"waiting\"><iframe data-km-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/maps/39s9f7iuoe6.htm\" title=\"고잔점 카카오 지도\" width=\"800\" height=\"398\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe><p class=\"km-map-status\">카카오 지도</p></div><div class=\"km-details\"><dl><dt>주소</dt><dd>경기 안산시 단원구 광덕대로 130 폴리타운 B동 513호</dd></dl><section class=\"km-transit\"><h4>주변 정류장</h4><ul><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">1</span>폴리타운</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">2</span>미디어라이브러리</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">3</span>에이스프라자</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">4</span>레이크타운푸르지오</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">5</span>그린빌7단지</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">6</span>별빛광장</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">7</span>동남레이크빌</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">8</span>푸르지오1차아파트</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">9</span>안산문화숲의광장</li></ul></section><section class=\"km-transit\"><h4>주변 버스</h4><ul class=\"km-buses\"><li><span class=\"km-bus-kind\" data-type=\"0106\">일반</span><span class=\"km-route-names\"><span>70A</span><span>77</span><span>N70A</span><span>70B</span><span>N70B</span><span>10</span><span>123</span><span>3</span><span>50</span><span>80A</span><span>80C</span><span>90B</span><span>98</span><span>99-1</span><span>N80A(금요일,토요일운행)</span><span>80B</span><span>90A</span><span>N80B(금요일,토요일운행)</span></span></li><li><span class=\"km-bus-kind\" data-type=\"0110\">직행</span><span class=\"km-route-names\"><span>3100</span><span>3100N</span><span>3101</span><span>3103</span><span>5609</span><span>1100</span></span></li></ul></section><p class=\"km-traffic-note\">주변 교통 정보는 제공된 카카오맵 약도 기준입니다. 노선과 정차 여부는 운행 상황에 따